    "text": "Heat the oil in the same pan and cook the onion until it starts to colour, 5 minutes. Add the garlic and pepper flakes for a minute more. Scrape into the cooker along with the pepperoni and potatoes. Cover and cook until beans and potatoes are tender — 4 hours high, 6½ low."
